-- The Chamber of Ancients (the book's Area 1 map, 3A-3H), redrawn in our pieces and turned so north
-- is up. The book's arrangement: the door in from the entrance chamber at the north-west, past the
-- corner the entrance takes out of the room; the tablet and the daggers by the north wall; the
-- pedestal in the middle; the jackal jug, the crocodile tap and the falcon jar along the south
-- wall; the notebook by the slanting wall with the door on to the gift shop. Stretched to fill the
-- mat; the sarcophagus the guardian climbed out of is ours. The south wall is left off: the DM's side.

